### All students through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8085/api/students

### One student
GET http://localhost:8085/api/students/1

### Student with profile (student-service calls student-profile-service through Feign)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/students/1/full

### All profiles
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles

### Profile for student 1
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/student/1

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8085/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nina",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "nina.brown@example.com"
}

### Create a profile for the new student
POST http://localhost:8085/api/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 4,
  "major": "Data Science",
  "gpa": 3.85,
  "bio": "Enjoys analytics and cloud development."
}

### Full record for the new student
GET http://localhost:8085/api/students/4/full

### Direct calls that bypass the gateway (optional)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

###
GET http://localhost:8082/api/profiles
